  "contentHtml": "<h3 id=\"block-0b70c3c2aa7646fdb5d32e2eff46737d\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\"><strong>Artisan-designer et passionné des arbres, </strong><strong><a href=\"/collectif/olivier-vanhamme\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"/collectif/olivier-vanhamme\">Olivier</a></strong><strong> met ses compétences au service d’une société en changement.</strong></h3><div id=\"block-9d468880cf3249fe8e2908c0badfe160\" class=\"notion-column-list\"><div id=\"block-484953ae3ff8436da929396f187880a1\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><h1 id=\"block-673fc35350f84716a2fcef6d75a178fe\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Designer</h1><div id=\"block-aa541a41223443598d9fe5b5c9625f36\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/2027a809-858f-4c25-8151-fb9cb54de4c8/WhatsApp_Image_2023-10-02_at_15.53.56/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/2027a809-858f-4c25-8151-fb9cb54de4c8/WhatsApp_Image_2023-10-02_at_15.53.56/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/2027a809-858f-4c25-8151-fb9cb54de4c8/WhatsApp_Image_2023-10-02_at_15.53.56/public\"></span></div><p id=\"block-98dbd3ae2b9a4e938ee1ae3cd8732e3d\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Olivier vous accompagne dans la réalisation d’objets et espaces uniques, utiles et esthétiques qui ont du sens. Soit via des&nbsp;<a href=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/propositions/#ateliers\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/propositions/#ateliers\">ateliers</a>, soit via des&nbsp;<a href=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/propositions/#surmesure\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/propositions/#surmesure\">réalisations sur mesure</a>.</p></div><div id=\"block-55e8cb10ea3f4b3c900ce739b9d2ceab\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><h1 id=\"block-dca363e1fd43484183c14fee89271542\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Arboriste</h1><div id=\"block-acbf6069c9f6428c9be47774dd5a0f4d\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/6a400860-d5b7-44c6-827f-c155d867453b/olivier-vanhamme-arboriste/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/6a400860-d5b7-44c6-827f-c155d867453b/olivier-vanhamme-arboriste/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/6a400860-d5b7-44c6-827f-c155d867453b/olivier-vanhamme-arboriste/public\"></span></div><p id=\"block-e0949c2361c74481a92d5f52c5895fcb\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Olivier vous propose ses services pour de&nbsp;<a href=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/propositions/#elagage\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/propositions/#elagage\">l’élagage ou de l’abattage</a>.</p></div></div><div id=\"block-4e3aa654d3b84751b72e5cbeac2a5b4a\" class=\"notion-bookmark\"><a href=\"https://debranchesenplanches.be/\" class=\"notion-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"notion-bookmark__content\"><h5 class=\"notion-bookmark__title\">Accueil</h5><p class=\"notion-bookmark__description\">Comment prendre sa place dans une volonté de respect de l’Homme et de la Nature?</p><div class=\"notion-bookmark__link\"><div><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/9764ca61-b56a-4baa-add5-83311bb75f60/cropped-logo-pur-petit-192x192/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/9764ca61-b56a-4baa-add5-83311bb75f60/cropped-logo-pur-petit-192x192/public\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"notion-icon\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/9764ca61-b56a-4baa-add5-83311bb75f60/cropped-logo-pur-petit-192x192/public\"></span></div><p>debranchesenplanches.be</p></div></div></a></div>",
